data: {"type":"tool","id":"call_00_to4sr8s22eikjzd8e38a6air","name":"skill_view","state":"done","result":{"success":true,"name":"local-place-scan","description":"Use when finding local places/quán ăn near a location.","tags":["places","maps","google-maps","vietnam","browser","cdp","food"],"related_skills":["maps","browser-control","hermes-web-search-stack"],"content":"---\nname: local-place-scan\ndescription: \"Use when finding local places/quán ăn near a location.\"\nversion: 1.1.0\nauthor: hermes-agent\nlicense: MIT\nmetadata:\n  hermes:\n    tags: [places, maps, google-maps, vietnam, browser, cdp, food]\n    category: productivity\n    related_skills: [maps, browser-control, hermes-web-search-stack]\n---\n\n# Local Place Scan — find eateries/shops near a location\n\nFind real, current local places (quán ăn, cafes, shops, services) around a location when OSM data is thin. Core insight: **an empty OSM result is NOT \"no places\"** — eatery and small-shop POI coverage in Vietnam (rural, small towns) is often zero, and Overpass mirrors 429/time out at peak. Google Maps has the real data; drive it with the debug Chrome via `browser_exec`.\n\n## When to Use\n- \"tìm quán ăn / ăn sáng / café near <place>\" or any \"places near X\" ask.\n- The `maps` skill (`nearby`/`bbox`) returned empty or near-empty results.\n- You need current ratings, review counts, or hours for small local spots.\n\n## Procedure\n\n### Step 0 — OSM first (cheap), then identify the administrative unit\n- Try the `maps` skill once: `maps_client.py search \"<name>\"` (centroid + bbox), `nearby`/`bbox`. Keep whatever it returns; note the bbox.\n- web_search the bare place name: Vietnam's 2025 mergers renamed provinces and wards (an old \"thị trấn X\" may now be \"phường X\" of a different province). Wikipedia + the ward's gov portal give the merger chain and the tổ dân phố/thôn list — reuse those names when grouping results by area.\n- The geocode centroid is often a field — never treat it as the town center; a Maps search for a landmark (e.g. \"chợ <name>\") finds the actual settlement pin.\n- Nominatim / the `maps` skill often returns EMPTY for VN ward & old-district names (live: \"Neo, Bắc Giang\" & \"Thị trấn Nham Biền\" → 0 results). Center fallback: open Google Maps `search/<area name>, <province>` and read `@lat,lng` from `location.href` (live: Yên Dũng/Neo → 21.20, 106.26), then bias every category query on that point.\n\n### Step 1 — viewport-biased Google Maps searches (several SHORT queries)\n(browser mechanics per skill `browser-control` §0 — ensure CDP :9222; `browser_exec` attaches automatically.)\n\nURL pattern (`hl=vi` = Vietnamese labels):\n\n    https://www.google.com/maps/search/<urlencoded-query>/@<lat>,<lon>,<zoom>z?hl=vi\n\n- `@lat,lon,zoom` biases results to that viewport: 13–14z = whole ward, 15–16z = around the center. Center on the settlement pin, not the ward centroid.\n- One query per term: category first (\"quán ăn sáng\", \"quán ăn\", \"chợ\"), then dishes (\"phở\", \"bún\", \"bánh cuốn\", \"cháo\", \"xôi\", \"bánh mì\"). VN breakfast clusters around markets — search the chợ by name too.\n- Chain 4–6 searches in ONE `browser_exec` call: per query `new_tab(url)` → `wait_for_load()` → `wait_render()` → extract → print compact lines (keep prints short to survive output limits).\n- Speed (live 2026-10-07, CDP attached): ≈2–3 s/query — 3 queries + nav ≈ 11–14 s total; the scan is cheap, prefer several short queries.\n\n### Step 2 — extraction (results feed)\nPoll until the feed (or h1) renders:\n\n```python\ndef wait_render(t=20):\n    for _ in range(t):\n        if js('!!(document.querySelector(\"div[role=feed]\") || document.querySelector(\"h1\"))'):\n            return True\n        time.sleep(1)\n```\n\nExtract items:\n\n```js\n(() => {\n  const out = {h1: null, items: []};\n  const h1 = document.querySelector('h1'); out.h1 = h1 ? h1.innerText : null;\n  const feed = document.querySelector('div[role=\"feed\"]');\n  if (feed) {\n    out.items = [...feed.querySelectorAll(':scope > div')].slice(0,25).map(r => {\n      const a = r.querySelector('a.hfpxzc');\n      const img = r.querySelector('span[role=\"img\"]');\n      return {\n        name: a ? a.getAttribute('aria-label') : (r.innerText||'').split('\\n')[0],\n        rating: img ? img.getAttribute('aria-label') : null,  // \"4,8 sao 24 bài đánh giá\"\n        href: a ? a.href : null,   // keep full while working — !8m2!3d<lat>!4d<lon> carries coords\n        text: (r.innerText||'').replace(/\\n+/g,' | ').slice(0,200)\n      };\n    }).filter(x => x.name && !/xem hết danh sách|bộ lọc|xếp hạng/i.test(x.name));\n  }\n  return out;\n})()\n```\n\n- Leading feed rows are filter chrome (\"Xếp hạng · Giờ · Tất cả bộ lọc\") — filter them out.\n- A single-match search lands on a place page (no feed) — use h1 + `location.href`.\n- Item text carries a local plus code (e.g. `776F+H43`) — keep it; pasteable into Maps search, pins spots with no street address.\n\n### Step 3 — verify before labeling\n- Reverse-geocode promising items' coords (`maps_client.py reverse <lat> <lon>`): listing address text lags renames; the reverse reports the CURRENT ward. Fix area labels before reporting (live: 3 hits were actually in neighboring wards, not the one searched).\n- Sanity-check distances: 1° lat ≈ 111 km, 1° lon ≈ 104 km at 21°N.\n\n### Step 4 — answer shape (Sếp's proven format)\n- Group by area: center (ngã tư/market) → rest of the ward → markets → nearby 4–8 km.\n- Per spot: **name** — ⭐rating (review count) — street/plus code — one-line note (dish + a real review quote when one exists).\n- Links that work on mobile + desktop: `https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=<urlencoded name + area>`\n- State plainly that most spots are small with few reviews (Google data as of scan day); never inflate. Offer the next step: drill into one quán (hours/photos) or route from the user's location.\n\n## Pitfalls\n- **Google Places API (official) is NOT available for Vietnam accounts** — Google lists Vietnam as a Prohibited Territory for Maps Platform; the Cloud Console blocks enablement with \"Maps Platform unavailable in this region… prohibited territories\" (verified 2026-10; ToS page `cloud.google.com/maps-platform/terms/maps-prohibited-territories` names Vietnam). Do NOT try to obtain a key for a VN-billed account; use this browser scan (consumer Maps) or VN providers Goong/Vietmap/Map4D instead.\n- **Goong API key requires manual admin activation**: signup works (Google-OAuth sign-in offered, no password), but key creation shows \"Bạn chỉ có thể tạo key khi được admin kích hoạt\" — the old auto-activate-after-24h mechanism is gone and a phone number is mandatory. Activation needs a support contact whose phone matches the account: hotlines **0869 697 502** (kỹ thuật) / **0904 522 538** (kế toán), or email **admin@goong.io** sent from the account's registered address — a Google-OAuth account has no phone on file, so state the registered email and offer a contact phone. `support@goong.io` is **DEAD** — it bounces `550 5.1.1 does not exist` (live 2026-10-06); the contact page now lists admin@goong.io only — never cc support. (Mail to admin@goong.io was accepted without bounce, same day.) Factor the support step into any promise of a Goong key.\n- **Goong console has NO daily request cap** — the key-creation \"Giới Hạn\" tab restricts by URL/IP only; enforce usage caps client-side (free tier **1000 req/ngày**; auto-alerts at 15%/25% of the balance). Endpoints, params and response shapes for the v2 REST API: `references/goong-api-v2.md`.\n- **Overpass mirror reality (live-checked 2026-10-06)**: only `overpass-api.de` works reliably — it takes transient HTTP 504s under load (retry). `overpass.osm.ch` returns EMPTY payloads (0 elements even for Hà Nội center — silent data loss; never use it). osm.jp TLS broken; kumi / private.coffee / openstreetmap.ru unreachable. The repo pipeline's `vn_geo.overpass_poi.fetch` retries per mirror (`attempts=2`, 90s timeout); CKAN fetches 60s. A tiny de result can be REAL rural sparsity (Yên Dũng bbox: 5 amenities total in OSM).\n- Don't conclude \"no quán\" from OSM/Overpass emptiness — that's the normal state for VN eateries; this scan is the answer path.\n- Don't run one long query (\"quán ăn sáng ngon <xã> <tỉnh>\") — Maps matches names poorly; several short terms sweep far more listings.\n- A 14z search around a rural ward pulls in the next city's results — check each item's coords/ward (Step 3) before grouping; don't present distant spots as \"in the ward\".\n- Review counts of 1–5 mean little — say so; prefer higher counts when ranking, and never dress a 1-review spot as \"top\".\n\n## Cross-refs\n`maps` (OSM/geocode/routing — try first) · `browser-control` (CDP mechanics; if its launcher doesn't bring :9222 up within ~10 s, use its manual Start-Process form — don't re-run the launcher in a loop) · `hermes-web-search-stack` (web_search for the place-name/merger research) · `email-sending` (sending a Goong/VN support email from the user's account).\n","path":"productivity\\local-place-scan\\SKILL.md","skill_dir":"C:\\Users\\atton\\AppData\\Local\\hermes\\skills\\productivity\\local-place-scan","linked_files":{"references":["references/goong-api-v2.md"]},"usage_hint":"To view linked files, call skill_view(name, file_path) where file_path is e.g. 'references/api.md' or 'assets/config.yaml'","required_environment_variables":[],"required_commands":[],"missing_required_environment_variables":[],"missing_credential_files":[],"missing_required_commands":[],"setup_needed":false,"setup_skipped":false,"readiness_status":"available","_source_path":"C:\\Users\\atton\\AppData\\Local\\hermes\\skills\\productivity\\local-place-scan\\SKILL.md","metadata":{"hermes":{"tags":["places","maps","google-maps","vietnam","browser","cdp","food"],"category":"productivity","related_skills":["maps","browser-control","hermes-web-search-stack"]}}}}

data: {"type":"tool","id":"call_01_rdy1f5jlw4q9s5t75sr2tpam","name":"tool_describe","state":"done","result":{"tools":{"mcp__hermes_search__hermes_places":{"description":"Query the local places db via ``vn_geo.places`` (r16 §1).\n\nReturns ``{ok, kind: \"places\", query, area, count, places,\nviewport}``: a blank *query* browses (``text=None``), *count* is\nclamped to 1..50, and rows map 1:1 onto the frozen Place schema.\nNever raises — a missing db or query failure returns ``ok=False``\nwith an ``error`` string.\n","parameters":{"properties":{"query":{"title":"Query","type":"string"},"area":{"type":"string","nullable":true,"title":"Area","default":null},"category":{"type":"string","nullable":true,"title":"Category","default":null},"min_rating":{"type":"number","nullable":true,"title":"Min Rating","default":null},"count":{"default":8,"title":"Count","type":"integer"}},"required":["query"],"type":"object","title":"hermes_placesArguments"}}}}}

